{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在江西龍虎山，瀘溪河猶如蜿蜒玉帶，將兩岸矗立的奇峰怪石串聯起來，共同繪畫出一幅流動的丹青長卷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JX.MOUNTAIN.MTV.0818-0921_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jqILxwVk2F1789954305.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JX.MOUNTAIN.MTV.0818-0921_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:58:43.393827+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":47,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}